  "summary": "The evidence (README.md and I18N_README.md) documents a GitLab-based coding agent that relays issue/MR events through a Flask webhook service to CI/CD pipelines running GitHub Copilot CLI, with three workflows (issue assignment, MR note updates, MR review) and multilingual prompt templates. Evidence coverage: 149 of 302 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
